#
# The build context is the repository root, and the image needs exactly
# two paths out of it. Everything else — the sources, the Gradle caches,
# the rest of the front end's build directory, several hundred megabytes
# in total — is excluded first and the two paths are added back, so the
# context stays what the image actually copies.

*
!docker/default.conf
!frontend/web/build/dist/wasmJs/productionExecutable
